and main features required for launch:\n\n- Multiplayer Core: Lobby, room creation, and joining (via Photon Fusion).\n\n- Meta Space (Scene) Integration: The core experience requires users to scan and use their Meta Space data (Scene API), allowing them to share a virtual representation of their physical room.\n\n- Mixed Reality (MR) Features:\n\n-- A hand-activated UI (the \"Hive\" menu) allows users to toggle a private Mixed Reality (Passthrough) Mode.\n\n-- A unique \"Mixed Reality Camera\" feature enables users to capture their real-world view and share it as a static image with others in the session.\n\n- Synchronized Exit: A \"Ready to Leave\" system ensures all users in a session agree before returning to the lobby.\n\n- User Reporting Functionality (VRC.Content.3 Compliance): A user reporting system has been integrated, allowing users to notify the developer about conduct that violates the Code of Conduct for Virtual Experiences. This form is accessible from in-app actions.\n\n- User Stuck (VRC.Quest.Functional.3): The system now performs more robust checks on space data status and provides users with real-time status information through a loading screen within the Hive scene.", "created_date": 1761921691, "id": "24634689662900748", "version": "0.1.6", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24417022141334169", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24732301959806184"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "695204420268532"}]}, "change_log": "Early Access (Build v0.1.0)\n\n\n\nThis build includes the core user flow and main features required for launch:\n\n- Multiplayer Core: Lobby, room creation, and joining (via Photon Fusion).\n\n- Meta Space (Scene) Integration: The core experience requires users to scan and use their Meta Space data (Scene API), allowing them to share a virtual representation of their physical room.\n\n- Mixed Reality (MR) Features: \n\n-- A hand-activated UI (the \"Hive\" menu) allows users to toggle a private Mixed Reality (Passthrough) Mode.\n\n-- A unique \"Mixed Reality Camera\" feature enables users to capture their real-world view and share it as a static image with others in the session.\n\n- Synchronized Exit: A \"Ready to Leave\" system ensures all users in a session agree before returning to the lobby.\n\n- User Reporting Functionality (VRC.Content.3 Compliance): A user reporting system has been integrated, allowing users to notify the developer about conduct that violates the Code of Conduct for Virtual Experiences. This form is accessible from in-app actions.", "created_date": 1761754377, "id": "24617362487966799", "version": "0.1.5", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}